sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as App
    participant Map as ObservableMap
    participant MO as MapObserver
    participant ObOn as ObservableObserveOn
    participant OO as ObserveOnObserver
    participant SubOn as ObservableSubscribeOn
    participant SO as SubscribeOnObserver
    participant Io as IoScheduler
    participant Task as SubscribeTask
    participant ObsCreate as ObservableCreate
    participant Emitter as CreateEmitter
    participant Src as ObservableOnSubscribe
    participant Q as SpscLinkedArrayQueue
    participant W as NewThreadWorker
    participant Fn as Function
    participant Obs as Observer

    rect rgb(226, 239, 255)
        Note over App,Io: 主线程  只订链，不发业务数据
        App->>Map: subscribe(observer)
        Map->>Map: subscribeActual(observer)
        Map->>MO: new MapObserver(observer, mapper)
        Map->>ObOn: source.subscribe(MO)
        ObOn->>ObOn: subscribeActual(MO)
        ObOn->>W: NewThreadScheduler.createWorker()
        ObOn->>OO: new ObserveOnObserver(MO, worker)
        ObOn->>SubOn: source.subscribe(OO)
        SubOn->>SubOn: subscribeActual(OO)
        SubOn->>SO: new SubscribeOnObserver(OO)
        SubOn->>OO: onSubscribe(SO)
        OO->>MO: onSubscribe(OO)
        MO->>Obs: onSubscribe(MO)
        Note right of Obs: Disposable 实际是 MapObserver
        SubOn->>Io: scheduleDirect(new SubscribeTask(SO))
        Note over SubOn,Io: 第一次切线程：把订上游丢到 io
    end

    rect rgb(255, 236, 209)
        Note over Io,W: io 线程  create 发射 + observeOn 入队
        Io->>Task: run()
        Task->>ObsCreate: source.subscribe(SO)
        ObsCreate->>ObsCreate: subscribeActual(SO)
        ObsCreate->>Emitter: new CreateEmitter(SO)
        ObsCreate->>SO: onSubscribe(Emitter)
        Note right of SO: 不再转发给 Observer，onSubscribe 已在主线程调过
        ObsCreate->>Src: source.subscribe(Emitter)
        Src->>Emitter: onNext(1)
        Emitter->>SO: onNext(1)
        SO->>OO: onNext(1)
        Note over SO,OO: subscribeOn 不切事件线程，只原样转发
        OO->>Q: offer(1)
        OO->>W: schedule(this)
        Note over OO,W: 第二次切线程：事件入队后交给 newThread drain
    end

    rect rgb(220, 245, 220)
        Note over W,Obs: newThread  出队 + map + 回调
        W->>OO: run / drainNormal()
        OO->>Q: poll 得到 1
        OO->>MO: onNext(1)
        MO->>Fn: apply(1)
        Fn-->>MO: 返回 "1"
        MO->>Obs: onNext("1")
    end
